@startuml
skinparam dpi 300

!theme blueprint
class Citizen{
   + void askForJob()
   + void tellProblem()
}

class Proxy{
  + void listen(String problem)
  + void findJob(String name)
  - boolean worthHisTime(String problem)
}

class PM{
  + void listen(String problem)
  + void findJob(String name)
  - void resolve(String problem)
}
Citizen -> Proxy
Proxy -> PM
@enduml